    "title": "MICROSERVICE-batchinsertion-List Pharmacy Prescriptions Historys-v2-spec",
    "description": "The Pharmacy Prescription History API provides access to a comprehensive list of prescriptions that have been filled at a pharmacy. This endpoint allows users to retrieve historical prescription records, facilitating improved patient care and adherence to medication schedules. Typical consumers include healthcare providers, pharmacists, and system integrators who need to access patient medication histories for treatment decision-making. By leveraging this API, users can ensure informed prescriptions and better manage patient treatment plans.",
